  "channel_view_review": "No dedicated desktop view-state operation is specified. LocalRange.channelId is a hue-adjustment range, not channel visibility. ActionsOptions accepts actionJSON/ATN/UXP; those general execution workflows could express channel actions but are separately unimplemented. Photato per-document display state and PNG preview are Photato-only extensions, not Adobe conformance.",
  "status_envelope_review": "Pinned JobAcceptedResponse uses jobId/statusUrl; JobStatusResponse uses result/errorDetails and not_started/running/succeeded/failed. Guide inconsistencies must be resolved in endpoint tests; no live service responses tested.",
